{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>香港天文台於今日（11月18日）稍早時間發出特別天氣提示，指出一道冷鋒正逐漸向南移動，預計稍後會橫過廣東沿岸地區。本港天氣將有一兩陣雨，並於晚上開始氣溫下降。\n</p>\n<p>未來一兩日天氣將顯著轉涼，市區最低氣溫預計在15至16度，新界地區則會再低兩至三度。此外，受強烈東北季候風影響，星期五及星期六初時高地風寒效應將較為明顯，天氣寒冷。</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民，特別是進行戶外活動的人士，需密切留意天氣變化，注意保暖措施，並關心長者及慢性病患者的健康狀況。請確保穿著足夠禦寒衣物，並避免長時間暴露於寒冷環境中。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%86%b7%e9%8b%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">冷鋒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 18 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T18:38:58.734860+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T18:15:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T23:36:05.542600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T18:32:25.462139+00:00","content_hash":"35f9eedea9dd7dbfc2b9e51fea9667d2877a6ee0cb939245641497adcb611c13","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}